R10-R02-12,R02,西面门道,坊门槽、咸池地望与文献白马不作同体接续,槽和基础支持门址解释，W25只提供同大道地望；道南文献白马与考古坊区没有本轮新成立的共同定位。,槽用遗迹解释签而非渠；咸池留在宝光园属窗，文献白马仍在道南窗，两者不与坊口拉水线或身份实线。,完整门楼、槽构造、池与坊口距离、寺坊同体和各街目标年使用层仍未知。,文献地望与发掘局部时期未核同；不将已知名称升级成完整寺址。,"[""w_baima_xiyang"", ""w_xianchi""]","[""X02"", ""G11"", ""O02""]","[""W25""]","[{""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/9""}, {""path"": ""research/city-nodes-r7/reviews/baima.json"", ""pointer"": ""/findings/4""}, {""path"": ""research/city-nodes-r7/reviews/baima.json"", ""pointer"": ""/findings/5""}, {""path"": ""research/city-nodes-r7/reviews/baima.json"", ""pointer"": ""/findings/7""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b5/west-roads.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/22""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b5/west-roads.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/23""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/20""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/75""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/9""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/13""}]","[{""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/9"", ""sha256"": ""012f82e3ae6fe5f808fe4161ca062a9ab6543bf64ece2cab7712a489eeb68e3d"", ""excerpt"": ""槽与基础支撑门址解释；W25只提供同大道地望；北魏归属不能细分全部路面年份。；坊口以开口符号表示，槽不画成渠，咸池只留独立索引并加同期性说明。；门楼平面、槽的构造、池至坊口关系及道路具体使用层仍待核。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json""}, {""path"": ""research/city-nodes-r7/reviews/baima.json"", ""pointer"": ""/findings/4"", ""sha256"": ""f8c14bcdb8be05ccdb4f7331b4cd3d4af69623d2fc469d4970fa1831946a4e1a"", ""excerpt"": ""2024材料据铺垫地面及叠压推论筑坊活动；2025材料说交会遗迹处在北魏废弃堆积下。两类信息均未将每段路面独立定到516—528年。；需要具体路面与废弃堆积的层号、剖面及断代材料。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/