R10-R03-01,R03,宫苑与西北,瑶光、千秋与两座园林保持参照身份,瑶光在西城阊阖门道北，千秋在其东；西游园是千秋门内道北园地，不与华林园合并。,拆出门道、园属、台上井、台下池；台下不生成台南方向边。,两路接续、园界、观台足迹和高程未知。,瑶光五层为形制记述，500余间不能生成逐间平面。,"[""ic_yaoguang"", ""ic_qianqiu_gate"", ""ic_xiyou_garden"", ""ic_hualin"", ""ic_bihai_pool""]","[""T03"", ""T04""]","[""W21""]","[{""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/0""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/1""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/2""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/3""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/4/segments/2""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/4/segments/3""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/23""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/24""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/9""}]","[{""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/0"", ""sha256"": ""0567bcd6c9d3b4e6a0fc3c0100b92d4bbe31f25e6244d45d803a0ec13f5100bf"", ""excerpt"": ""在閶闔城門御道北，東去千秋門二里。；保留道北与向东至千秋门；二里不换算像素。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/1"", ""sha256"": ""0567bcd6c9d3b4e6a0fc3c0100b92d4bbe31f25e6244d45d803a0ec13f5100bf"", ""excerpt"": ""有五層浮圖一所……講殿尼房，五百餘間。；五层塔与讲殿尼房都有记述，群内位置没有给定。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/2"", ""sha256"": ""0567bcd6c9d3b4e6a0fc3c0100b92d4bbe31f25e6244d45d803a0ec13f5100bf"", ""excerpt"": ""千秋門內道北有西游園，園中有凌雲臺。；门内、道北、园中三个层级分别存储。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/3"", ""sha256"": ""0567bcd6c9d3b4e6a0fc3c0100b92d4bbe31f25e6244d45d803a0ec13f5100bf"", ""excerpt"": ""臺上有八角井，高祖於井北造涼風觀。；井在台上；凉风观在井北。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/4/segments/2"", ""sha256"": ""6703af3308fff4e266c3e50c6fcd2d8f8e357c08ceb678f0e327d37dbd18467d"", ""excerpt"": ""千秋門內道北有西游園，園中有凌雲臺。……臺下有碧海曲池。；“园中有凌云台”明示台在西游园内；该园又在千秋门内道北。正文“凌”与周注校作“陵”分别展示。；这一所属关系不提供园界或台位坐标，不借此将西游园与华林园合并。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/4/segments/3"", ""sha256"": ""6703af3308fff4e266c3e50c6fcd2d8f8e357c08ceb678f0e327d37dbd18467d"", ""excerpt"": ""千秋門內道北有西游園，園中有凌雲臺。……臺下有碧海曲池。；碧海曲池属于瑶光寺所附西游园的台下景物叙述；它与华林园段的玄武、流觞、扶桑分开。；“台下”只说明台基上下关系，不是台南；园中有台不等于已量园界。不能由后面的“凡此诸海”直接分配一条供水到碧海，也不据此否认任何实际水路。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/23"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""在閶闔城門御道北。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url""