R10-R03-02,R03,宫苑与西北,殿台方向与园林数量各归对象,宣慈在凌云台东、灵芝在宣慈东；宣光南、嘉福北、九龙西的参照是灵芝台。,西游窗补灵芝与宣光、嘉福、九龙的四条明示方向；不以四殿总称补一座无名殿或确定飞廊。,完整殿台中轴、廊道长度、出于海中所指及内部尺寸未定。,文学盛景不替代构件分期，楼观相连不保证同一时期原样保存。,"[""ic_xuanci"", ""ic_lingzhi"", ""ic_xuanguang"", ""ic_jiafu"", ""ic_jiulong""]",[],[],"[{""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/4""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/5""}]","[{""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/4"", ""sha256"": ""0567bcd6c9d3b4e6a0fc3c0100b92d4bbe31f25e6244d45d803a0ec13f5100bf"", ""excerpt"": ""臺東有宣慈觀……觀東有靈芝釣臺，累木為之，出於海中。；台东宣慈、观东灵芝；海承碧海是工作回指。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/5"", ""sha256"": ""0567bcd6c9d3b4e6a0fc3c0100b92d4bbe31f25e6244d45d803a0ec13f5100bf"", ""excerpt"": ""釣臺南有宣光殿，北有嘉福殿，西有九龍殿……凡四殿，皆有飛閣向靈芝往來。；三处方位明文与四殿总括分别保留，不据总数补一个未知殿址。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json""}]"
R10-R03-03,R03,宫苑与西北,华林海内人工山台与天然地形区分,天渊池内九华台与人工蓬莱山可表示所属；钓台宫回指九华或蓬莱仍未统一。；九华台上的清凉殿、蓬莱山上的仙人馆分别属于对应台山,海内构件用包含关系，人工山标明营造性质；不向现代DSM高点拉线。；补台上、山上构件成员签,古池岸、水位、山台体量及钓台宫准确对象未知。,前代地名和北魏改造分别保留，不由同名推旧址形态连续。,"[""ic_hualin"", ""ic_tianyuan"", ""ic_jiuhua"", ""ic_penglai"", ""ic_diaotai_palace"", ""ic_qingliang"", ""ic_xianren""]",[],"[""W15"", ""W16""]","[{""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/6""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/7""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/8""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/14""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/15""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/88""}]","[{""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/6"", ""sha256"": ""0567bcd6c9d3b4e6a0fc3c0100b92d4bbe31f25e6244d45d803a0ec13f5100bf"", ""excerpt"": ""泉西有華林園……池中猶有文帝九華臺。高祖於臺上造清涼殿。；园在泉西；九华台属池内；清凉殿在台上。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/7"", ""sha256"": ""0567bcd6c9d3b4e6a0fc3c0100b92d4bbe31f25e6244d45d803a0ec13f5100bf"", ""excerpt"": ""世宗在海內作蓬萊山，山上有僊人館。；记录人工营作与山上馆，不把它对应为现代DEM中某个天然高点。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/8"", ""sha256"": ""0567bcd6c9d3b4e6a0fc3c0100b92d4bbe31f25e6244d45d803a0ec13f5100bf"", ""excerpt"": ""上有釣臺殿。；周补台而回指九华台；其他本作山，范保留异文。两种解释分开。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/14"", ""sha256"": ""bf51dad84680792dafbaacb14bea0a0715fa31a5cf13842fd0096f762132a789"", ""excerpt"": ""{\""旧编号\"": \""W15\"", \""旧称\"": \""翟泉／苍龙海\"", \""本册图段\"": \""I02、I10\"", \""状态\"": \""本册分段或分期；不新增岸线\""}"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/15"", ""sha256"": ""bf51dad84680792dafbaacb14bea0a0715fa31a5cf13842fd0096f762132a789"", ""excerpt"": ""{\""旧编号\"": \""W16\"", \""旧称\"": \""华林园大海／天渊池\"", \""本册图段\"": \""I01、I02\"", \""状态\"": \""本册分段或分期；不新增岸线\""}"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/88"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""華林園中有大海，即漢（魏）天淵池。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}]"
R10-R03-04,R03,宫苑与西北,都堂、扶桑海与流觞池采用当前复核,都堂在柰林西，扶桑海在都堂东；流觞池只在都堂所述地段，不是堂内或堂南水池。,纠正可能把扶桑写为殿或把流觞画入堂内的读法；用同处记述线保留非定位关系。,两池岸线、互通与出入水口未知。,沿用P468当前判断，不宣称本轮新获古本或原件。,"[""ic_nailin"", ""ic_dutang"", ""ic_fusang"", ""ic_liushang""]",[],"[""W18"", ""W19""]","[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/108""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/4/segments/4""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/4/segments/5""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/6""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/7""}]","[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/108"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""柰林西有都堂，有流觴池，堂東有扶桑海。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/4/segments/4"", ""sha256"": ""6703af3308fff4e266c3e50c6fcd2d8f8e357c08ceb678f0e327d37dbd18467d"", ""excerpt"": ""柰林西有都堂，有流觴池。堂東有扶桑海。；以“都堂所述地段”为地点框，保存“有流觞池”。包含只指同处记述，既不是堂内建筑池，也不是池在堂南。；“有流觞池”只表示都堂所述地段有池，不解释为堂内建筑池或堂南；不能由二池同条并列推二池互通或各池口流向。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/4/segments/5"", ""sha256"": ""6703af3308fff4e266c3e50c6fcd2d8f8e357c08ceb678f0e327d37dbd18467d"", ""excerpt"": ""柰林西有都堂，有流觴池。堂東有扶桑海。；“堂东有扶桑海”提供明确东侧关系；图中都堂所述地段用作方位参照，不确定池口或岸形。；“有流觞池”只表示都堂所述地段有池，不解释为堂内建筑池或堂南；不能由二池同条并列推二池互通或各池口流向。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luo