R10-R03-10,R03,宫苑与西北,景阳山景保持部分方向而不排成全序,海西南的景山殿／景阳山仍有名物校读；以该山为参照的羲和东、姮娥西、清暑南、百果南分别保存。；羲和岭上的温风室与姮娥峰上的露寒馆分别归属，不同名互换,补山景组和峰上、殿侧成员；清暑与百果不互连为南北先后，名物未决主体用条件签。；补岭上温风室，山景构件均无古代地形坐标,山与殿身份、人工地形轮廓、峰岭高差和清暑百果次序未知。,命名和文学游赏不等于现代地貌实测或统一施工时点。,"[""ic_jingyang_hill"", ""ic_tianyuan"", ""ic_xihe"", ""ic_henge"", ""ic_qingshu"", ""ic_baiguo"", ""ic_luhan"", ""ic_linjian"", ""ic_linwei"", ""ic_wenfeng""]",[],[],"[{""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/9""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/10""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/11""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b8/cross-batch-review.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/11""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/101""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/102""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/103""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/104""}]","[{""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/9"", ""sha256"": ""0567bcd6c9d3b4e6a0fc3c0100b92d4bbe31f25e6244d45d803a0ec13f5100bf"", ""excerpt"": ""海西南有景山殿。；周疑景阳山；范提出景阳殿可能。继续记录两说，不将殿名硬等于山。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/10"", ""sha256"": ""0567bcd6c9d3b4e6a0fc3c0100b92d4bbe31f25e6244d45d803a0ec13f5100bf"", ""excerpt"": ""山東有羲和嶺……山西有姮娥峰……山南有清暑殿。；方向关系沿现有周校工作读法；峰上露寒馆及岭上温风室分别记录。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/11"", ""sha256"": ""0567bcd6c9d3b4e6a0fc3c0100b92d4bbe31f25e6244d45d803a0ec13f5100bf"", ""excerpt"": ""山南有清暑殿……山南有百果園。；百果园和清暑殿都在山南，彼此前后没有明文。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b2/palace-gardens.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b8/cross-batch-review.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/11"", ""sha256"": ""a3be93e2afc09501b56a00d52d2d0143812104b92c4c23d651c1bb0505b96592"", ""excerpt"": ""宫苑两个山南对象、大市东两里、同在大觉以东的融觉与永明、四馆四里目录，分别给出共同参照或列名，均不够排成一条全序。B8 需要保留这些不同类型的缺边，避免为了全城版面整齐而把它们补成南北行列或正对街面。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b8/cross-batch-review.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/101"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""嶺上有溫風室。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/102"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""峰上有露寒館。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/103"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""殿東有臨澗亭。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/104"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""殿西有臨危臺。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}]"
R10-R04-01,R04,建春门与城东北,三桥身份、方向与事件各归本条,第一桥、东石桥、七里桥分记录；东石桥南北通行，527颓桥仅作用于第一桥。,第一桥附时间标识，第二桥标纵向通行，七里桥另置东向里序窗。,三桥桥头、共同坐标及第一桥528年前修复状态未知。,516—528为综合窗口；不能把第一桥全窗口都画成毁坏或完整。,"[""bridge_jianchun"", ""bridge_eaststone"", ""bridge_qili""]","[""B01"", ""B02"", ""B03""]",[],"[{""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/15""}, {""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/16""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/16""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/79""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/80""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/81""}]","[{""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/15"", ""sha256"": ""012f82e3ae6fe5f808fe4161ca062a9ab6543bf64ece2cab7712a489eeb68e3d"", ""excerpt"": ""建春门外石桥、东石桥、七里桥分别叙述；527年大雨事件承接第一桥。；三桥分别设关系组，第一桥独立附527年状态；不画三桥共轴或同受损。；三桥共同控制、桥头及第一桥528年前修复状态未定。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json""}, {""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/16"", ""sha256"": ""012f82e3ae6fe5f808fe4161ca062a9ab6543bf64ece2cab7712a489eeb68e3d"", ""excerpt"": ""东石桥南北向，桥北大道西建阳里、东绥民里；七里桥东一里至三门。；东石桥改用纵向桥符和两侧里名；七里桥至三门另列方向关系，不从门名起算七里。；T09与桥北大道交叉位置、桥头、旅人桥同一性及营造异说未解决。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/16"", ""sha256"": ""2459e1deb79bc45514d49e2560f37138024f4469adad10ae95d0150122125a64"", ""excerpt"": ""逮我孝昌三年大雨頹橋，南柱始埋沒，道北二柱，至今猶存。；527事件作用于本条建春门石桥，不是永桥或东石桥。至今为叙述参照，未强定成547年观察日；后续修复和通行状态未记。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.7/passages.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/79"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""穀水周圍遶城，至建春門外，東入陽渠石橋。逮我孝昌三年大雨頹橋，南柱始埋沒，道北二柱，至今猶存。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/80"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""出建春門外一里餘，至東石橋。南北而行，晉太康元年造。橋北大道西有建陽里，大道東有綏民里。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/81"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""崇義里東有七里橋，以石為之。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}]"
R10-R04-02,R04,建春门与城东北,桥北大道两里与郭门里程分别表达,建阳在桥北大道西，绥民在东；崇义东接七里桥的文本关系与桥东一里到三门另起。；洛阳县署属于绥民里，临渠只说明邻水而不定哪一岸足迹,保留路侧边与逐项东西边，不增加连续跨越三桥的道路。；县署挂入绥民里，不作独立测量点,大道与建春御道交会、坊界、三门墙线与桥北完整路端未核。,东石桥晋营造叙述不等于北魏所有桥面原样未修。,"[""road_eaststone_north"", ""li_jianyang"", ""li_suimin"", ""li_chongyi"", ""bridge_qili"", ""gate_sanmen"", ""office_luoyang""]","[""G10"", ""T09"", ""T10""]",[],"[{""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/1""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/150""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/153""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/154""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/74""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/29""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/30""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/149""}]","[{""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/1"", ""sha256"": ""2459e1deb79bc45514d49e2560f37138024f4469adad10ae95d0150122125a64"", ""excerpt"": ""出建春門外一里餘，至東石橋。南北而行，晉太康元年造。橋北大道西有建陽里，大道東有綏民里。；一里余保留原单位；桥南北通行不等于两旁水段可以互通。桥北道路的东西里属明确。东石桥与水经马市桥的同体仍是识别前提。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.7/passages.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/150"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""綏民里東，〔有〕崇義里。里內有京兆人杜子休宅。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/153"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""崇義里東有七里橋，以石為之。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/154"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""七里橋東一里，郭門開三道，時人號為三門。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/74"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""七里橋東一里，郭門開三道，時人號為三門。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/29"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""瓔珞寺在建春門外御道北。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/30"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""橋北大道西有建陽里，大道東有綏民里。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/149"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""里內有洛陽縣，臨渠水。縣門外有洛陽令楊機清德碑。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}]"
R10-R04-03,R04,建春门与城东北,常满仓旧址与租场使用分开,旧常满仓高祖改租场的叙事，连同明悬东、龙华南两项参照可联读；同名东安租场仍另记。；明悬在第一桥南，龙华在本条阳渠南，两个方向不能互换参照,用仓场用途签呈现现用与旧址，未按仓名绘造屋顶或与东安租场合院。；补齐寺、桥、渠与租场的逐段依据,两段租场是否同一或连续、仓房存续与场地边界未知。,晋中朝旧仓不等于516—528粮仓形体，改用时间与现存建筑分别判断。,"[""v2_changmancang"", ""v2_mingxuan"", ""v2_longhua"", ""v2_dongan_taxfield"", ""water_yangqu""]",[],[],"[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/141""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b6/southeast-outer.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/2""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/111""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/2""}]","[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/141"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""寺東有中朝時常滿倉，高祖令為租塲，天下貢賦所聚蓄也。寺南有租塲。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b6/southeast-outer.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/2"", ""sha256"": ""0f55556ef5307a5c4e42fccaac91863024e2a8faf64add3905c10bb544854448"", ""excerpt"": ""所謂東安里也。北為租塲。；北为租场紧接庄严寺和东安里，北向参照可落在寺或里，句中没有测量边界。建春段常满仓旧址改租场是另一组叙述，不能只因同名就合并。；未定的是两组租场是否同一或连续，以及北字具体修饰哪一级对象；不是已证明两处绝对不同。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b6/southeast-outer.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/111"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""明懸尼寺，彭城武宣王勰所立也。在建春門外石橋南。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/2"", ""sha256"": ""2459e1deb79bc45514d49e2560f37138024f4469adad10ae95d0150122125a64"", ""excerpt"": ""在建春門外陽渠南。陽渠北有建陽里。；寺与里分处水道南北；不能单由此判定岸线、渠宽或把全部阳渠记载合为一点。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.7/passages.json""}]"
R10-R04-04,R04,建春门与城东北,建春门内三署只共路侧,勾盾、典农、籍田同在门内道南，司农在籍田南；列名不给三署东西次序。,三署分别连接道路，不画成有序三院；司农用官署类型。,署间距离、院界、三署是否共区和完整道路尺度未定。,寺字在司农名中为官署制度名称，不自动转换成寺院时层。,"[""ic_jianchun_avenue"", ""ic_goudun"", ""ic_diannong"", ""ic_jitian"", ""ic_sinong""]","[""T08""]",[],"[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/78""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/79""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/80""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/81""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/28""}]","[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/78"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""建春門內御道南，有勾盾、典農、籍田三署。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/79"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""建春門內御道南，有勾盾、典農、籍田三署。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/80"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""建春門內御道南，有勾盾、典農、籍田三署。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/81"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""籍田南有司農寺。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/28"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""建春門內御道南。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}]"
R10-R04-05,R04,建春门与城东北,拟建东宫空地不补作已成东宫,道北空地拟作东宫，同时被说明为晋太仓处；与北魏东阳门内太仓不同。,显示空地／计划标签，不添加宫殿墙院和屋顶；两太仓继续保留各自身份。,计划执行与否、空地范围、晋遗址残留及北魏实物层未定。,拟作与现存是不同状态，旧址名称不提供当时建筑规模。,"[""ic_donggong_reserved"", ""ic_taicang_jin"", ""ic_taicang_wei""]","[""T08""]",[],"[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/82""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/83""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b6/southeast-inner.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/2""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b6/southeast-inner.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/4""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/28""}]","[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/82"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""御道北有空地，擬作東宮，晉中朝時太倉處也。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/83"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""晉中朝時太倉處也。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b6/southeast-inner.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/2"", ""sha256"": ""36c4ad46a3885216a01d141e97037f707b0b3c67dcc78a74eeec498e5ed14d43"", ""excerpt"": ""東陽門內道北〔有〕太倉導官二署。；正文直接给出东阳门内道北的两署。周补有并删太下衍北；范同样删去太北仓的北。周注所引《河南志》另说导官在太仓西，须与正文层分开；本批没有把这段注引算作第二个独立来源家族。；正文的并列不规定两署东西先后、相邻或共院；北魏东阳门内太仓不得与建春门内晋太仓旧址合并，署名也不提供仓房数量和尺寸。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b6/southeast-inner.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b6/southeast-inner.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/4"", ""sha256"": ""36c4ad46a3885216a01d141e97037f707b0b3c67dcc78a74eeec498e5ed14d43"", ""excerpt"": ""昭儀寺有池……明非翟泉也。……趙逸云：「此地是晉侍中石崇家池，池南有綠珠樓。」；作者以晋、今太仓分处建春与东阳门内，反驳学徒把昭仪池认作翟泉；此为明确的否定同一关系。石崇家池与绿珠楼则由后文赵逸发言引入，须保留旧址叙述的说话者与历史层。；本条没有池岸形状、面积、水位或与城内诸海连通的信息；绿珠楼的旧址说不能证明516—528年仍有楼，池也不能移到晋太仓旁以求同名一致。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b6/southeast-inner.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/28"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""建春門內御道南。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}]"
