ket.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/5"", ""sha256"": ""309c270cae3f5d47480428743580a3ec1ef478b0bd92d86736586a59a09bbf39"", ""excerpt"": ""市北慈孝、奉終二里。里內之人以賣棺槨為業，賃輀車為事。；显示棺椁与丧车生业。；不推断为墓地或逐铺院落。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b3/west-market.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b8/cross-batch-review.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/11"", ""sha256"": ""a3be93e2afc09501b56a00d52d2d0143812104b92c4c23d651c1bb0505b96592"", ""excerpt"": ""宫苑两个山南对象、大市东两里、同在大觉以东的融觉与永明、四馆四里目录，分别给出共同参照或列名，均不够排成一条全序。B8 需要保留这些不同类型的缺边，避免为了全城版面整齐而把它们补成南北行列或正对街面。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b8/cross-batch-review.json""}]"
R10-R05-03,R05,大市与寿丘,阜财、金肆只进入无方向目录,另有两里没有相对大市的明确方向，开善只确证阜财里属和宅改寺。,独立成员窗显示两里及开善，不给它们新增街面或与八里形成十格环。,两里彼此及与市场的方位、开善寺年和院界未明。,改寺叙事不等于已知建筑工期或原宅原样留存。,"[""w_fucai"", ""w_jinsi"", ""w_kaishan""]",[],[],"[{""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/6""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/7""}]","[{""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/6"", ""sha256"": ""309c270cae3f5d47480428743580a3ec1ef478b0bd92d86736586a59a09bbf39"", ""excerpt"": ""別有阜財、金肆二里，富人在焉。凡此十里，多諸工商貨殖之民。；将另两里列入无方位名录；阜财／准财校读并记。；不能画作两条新增有方向街区；十里不是十里长街。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b3/west-market.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/7"", ""sha256"": ""309c270cae3f5d47480428743580a3ec1ef478b0bd92d86736586a59a09bbf39"", ""excerpt"": ""阜財里內有開善寺，京兆人韋英宅也。……梁氏惶懼，捨宅為寺。；记录里属、宅改寺的用途变化。；没有改寺确年或独立院址，不因叙事赋坐标。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b3/west-market.json""}]"
R10-R05-04,R05,大市与寿丘,台、台上寺和周边县宅分层,皇女台市南主读与东南异记并存；灵仙立于台上，河阳县在台西，侯刚宅台东为校读。,分别用台、寺、县址和宅签，侯宅保留校读标识。,台高、寺足迹、县署范围及台东旁证原页尚未核定。,灵仙景明营造语可定位时代范围，不给台全部历史层统一建造年。,"[""w_huangnv"", ""w_lingxian"", ""w_heyang"", ""w_hougang""]",[],[],"[{""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/8""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/9""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/10""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/11""}]","[{""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/8"", ""sha256"": ""309c270cae3f5d47480428743580a3ec1ef478b0bd92d86736586a59a09bbf39"", ""excerpt"": ""市南有皇女臺。；市南主读与市东南异文并列。；南不必为正南；东南未必与南构成真实冲突。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b3/west-market.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/9"", ""sha256"": ""309c270cae3f5d47480428743580a3ec1ef478b0bd92d86736586a59a09bbf39"", ""excerpt"": ""景明中比丘道恆立靈僊寺於其上。；台与寺分为两个构件层级。；台上不证明台高、塔存在或寺院足迹。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b3/west-market.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/10"", ""sha256"": ""309c270cae3f5d47480428743580a3ec1ef478b0bd92d86736586a59a09bbf39"", ""excerpt"": ""臺西有河陽縣。；以县址名物而非具体县署院落表示。；县域、县治、县署仍需另证。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b3/west-market.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/11"", ""sha256"": ""309c270cae3f5d47480428743580a3ec1ef478b0bd92d86736586a59a09bbf39"", ""excerpt"": ""臺東有侍中侯剛宅。；保留台东校改和侯刚／侯钊异名。；本次未独立核河南志原页，旁证不重复计票。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b3/west-market.json""}]"
R10-R05-05,R05,大市与寿丘,寿丘四至不挪作沟渠起讫,延酤以西、张方沟以东、南洛北芒限定寿丘；二里与十五里是原文尺度。,将四至分标参照边，不闭合成长宽比固定的围墙，不延伸张方沟到芒山和洛水。,古沟线、古岸、山麓界和里域面积仍未知。,现代地形仅供背景；不得由原单位比值与现代河道求交古址。,"[""w_shouqiu"", ""w_yangu"", ""w_zhangfanggou"", ""luoshui"", ""mangshan""]",[],"[""W01"", ""W10""]","[{""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/13""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/0/segments/2""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/0""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/0""}]","[{""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/13"", ""sha256"": ""309c270cae3f5d47480428743580a3ec1ef478b0bd92d86736586a59a09bbf39"", ""excerpt"": ""自延酤以西，張方溝以東，南臨洛水，北達芒山，其間東西二里，南北十五里，並名為壽丘里。；四至与东西二里／南北十五里分别登记，保留原单位。；不将二比十五强制转成现代绘图长宽比。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b3/west-market.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/0/segments/2"", ""sha256"": ""6703af3308fff4e266c3e50c6fcd2d8f8e357c08ceb678f0e327d37dbd18467d"", ""excerpt"": ""自退酤以西，張方溝以東，南臨洛水，北達芒山。；寿丘位于张方沟以东。；南临洛水、北达芒山修饰寿丘范围，不能挪作沟的起讫。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/0"", ""sha256"": ""bf51dad84680792dafbaacb14bea0a0715fa31a5cf13842fd0096f762132a789"", ""excerpt"": ""{\""旧编号\"": \""W01\"", \""旧称\"": \""北魏洛水主河道\"", \""本册图段\"": \""P03、P08、R02、R07、R08\"", \""状态\"": \""本册分段或分期；不新增岸线\""}"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be