R10-R05-06,R05,大市与寿丘,河间王宅只画构件层级,文柏堂与后园迎风馆属于王宅构成，后园无自动北向；形如徽音殿不等于同尺度。,成员窗保留堂、馆及后园语义，不复制宫殿柱网和布局。,宅院足迹、园界、殿馆距离及立面尺寸未明。,河阴之后多宅改寺不等于全部王宅同年改寺；盛时保持宅用层。,"[""w_hejian"", ""w_wenbaitang"", ""w_yingfengguan""]",[],[],"[{""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/14""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/15""}]","[{""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/14"", ""sha256"": ""309c270cae3f5d47480428743580a3ec1ef478b0bd92d86736586a59a09bbf39"", ""excerpt"": ""造文柏堂，形如徽音殿。……造迎風館於後園。；分列文柏堂与后园迎风馆。；后园不等于北园；形如不证明开间尺度相同。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b3/west-market.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/15"", ""sha256"": ""309c270cae3f5d47480428743580a3ec1ef478b0bd92d86736586a59a09bbf39"", ""excerpt"": ""經河陰之役，諸元殲盡，王侯第宅，多題為寺。；盛时保留王宅名，后期部分改寺另记。；多不等于所有；无逐宅改寺年份和547全面存废状态。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b3/west-market.json""}]"
R10-R05-07,R05,大市与寿丘,西北土山鱼池旧迹不补当期水网,土山与鱼池在大市西北；营造归汉梁冀旧事，谷水在土山东不提供鱼池入水口。,保留复合旧登记并在文字分型，古池不与附近谷水自动连线。,二者内部相对位置、池岸、盛时是否积水和养鱼未明。,旧造记述不等于516—528全期运行证据。,"[""w_tushan_yuchi"", ""w_dashi"", ""gushui""]",[],"[""W04"", ""W26""]","[{""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/12""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/3/segments/5""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/3/segments/6""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/3/segments/7""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/3""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/14""}]","[{""path"": ""research/dual-b3/west-market.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/12"", ""sha256"": ""309c270cae3f5d47480428743580a3ec1ef478b0bd92d86736586a59a09bbf39"", ""excerpt"": ""市西北有土山魚池，亦冀之所造。；保留土山、鱼池并列构成与西北关系。；涉及汉代追述；不把现代低地推为汉池。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b3/west-market.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/3/segments/5"", ""sha256"": ""6703af3308fff4e266c3e50c6fcd2d8f8e357c08ceb678f0e327d37dbd18467d"", ""excerpt"": ""出西陽門外四里御道南，有洛陽大市，……市西北有土山魚池，亦冀之所造。即漢書所謂「採土築山，十里九坂，以象二崤」者。；“市西北有土山鱼池”按土山与鱼池两种对象显示，土山的营造归汉梁冀；方位参照为洛阳大市。；土山与鱼池图标的彼此位置只是排版，不是两者内部实测。不得据梁冀旧造把鱼池516—528全期仍有水或仍养鱼写为已证。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/3/segments/6"", ""sha256"": ""6703af3308fff4e266c3e50c6fcd2d8f8e357c08ceb678f0e327d37dbd18467d"", ""excerpt"": ""出西陽門外四里御道南，有洛陽大市，……市西北有土山魚池，亦冀之所造。即漢書所謂「採土築山，十里九坂，以象二崤」者。；同句列鱼池于大市西北；与土山分型显示，保留“土山鱼池”作为旧W26登记用语。；原文没有鱼池当时积水状态、出入水口或供水渠名；不强定“土山鱼池”为一个正式湖名，也不推鱼池与土山的内部排列。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/3/segments/7"", ""sha256"": ""6703af3308fff4e266c3e50c6fcd2d8f8e357c08ceb678f0e327d37dbd18467d"", ""excerpt"": ""穀水自閶闔門而南逕土山東，水西三里有坂，坂上有土山，漢大將軍梁冀所成，築土為山，植木成苑。；《水经注》明记谷水“逕土山东”；与《伽蓝记》的梁冀土山作地点比勘。本边只表示水在山东，不绘本图以外的河道流向。；该段没有鱼池通水句，不能把土山附近的谷水接给鱼池。“水西三里”保留古里程，不转米数；此处已核公开转录，数字页40原叶未目验。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/3"", ""sha256"": ""bf51dad84680792dafbaacb14bea0a0715fa31a5cf13842fd0096f762132a789"", ""excerpt"": ""{\""旧编号\"": \""W04\"", \""旧称\"": \""谷水／城周阳渠水系\"", \""本册图段\"": \""O01、O02、O03、O04、O05、O07、O08、O09、O10、O11、O12、O13、I01、I03、I05、I06、I07、I08、P04、P08、R06、R07、R08、R09\"", \""状态\"": \""本册分段或分期；不新增岸线\""}"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/14"", ""sha256"": ""6703af3308fff4e266c3e50c6fcd2d8f8e357c08ceb678f0e327d37dbd18467d"", ""excerpt"": ""{\""旧编号\"": \""W26\"", \""本册图\"": \""independent-pools\"", \""状态\"": \""已核可读关系、分期与边界；完整岸线或池口仍未定\""}"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json""}]"
R10-R05-08,R05,大市与寿丘,东平王宅只补寿丘里属，不落独立街址,追先寺前身是东平王略宅，寿丘里属采用既有校补记录；不与河间王宅合并。,在寿丘窗补前身宅成员和校补标识，不给宅门或独立寺墙。,校补的地理核验、宅位、院界和改寺完工年未知。,沿用前身宅层；本条不证明宅在516—528每一年都持续由原主使用。,"[""w_zhuixian"", ""w_shouqiu""]",[],[],"[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/269""}]","[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/269"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""追先寺，在壽丘里，侍中尚書令東平王略之宅也。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}]"
R10-R06-01,R06,西阳门内与永宁西邻,永康道南保持补字，西邻永宁保持直接参照,永康在西阳门内，道南采用补字读法；永宁西对永康另有正文关系。；元乂宅只确证属于永康里，未给里内方位,道南边明标校补，西邻边单独说明，不用一条关系假装两项互相证实。；补元乂的里属成员，不给门向或街址,里界、临路范围和永宁至里距未定。,本轮是既有校读的图形深化，不提高补字为确定地理事实。,"[""ic_yongkang"", ""ic_xiyang_avenue"", ""ic_yongning"", ""ic_yuancha_house""]","[""T02""]",[],"[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/38""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/1""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/22""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/39""}]","[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/38"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""西陽門內御道□〈南〉有永康里。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/1"", ""sha256"": ""bd00e4e455348162bed14493297edb10ed0ce216673deea94023a9c117440988"", ""excerpt"": ""其寺東有太尉府，西對永康里，南界昭玄曹，北鄰御史臺。；寺东不等于道路东；南界与北邻不提供院界尺寸。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.5/evidence.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/22"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""在西陽門內御道北。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/39"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""里內復有領軍將軍元乂宅。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.j