R10-R06-04,R06,西阳门内与永宁西邻,濛汜季节水情不作恒定湖面,濛汜在长秋北，夏有水冬竭；已撤回直接挂入华林诸海供水集合的索引。,单列季节池符和未明水口，不补通向谷水或华林的渠线。,池岸、池深、具体季节年份与供排水口未知。,季节叙述不是516—528逐年水位记录，也不能反推全年无水。,"[""ic_changqiu"", ""ic_mengfan_pool""]",[],"[""W20""]","[{""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/4/segments/0""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/corrections/0""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/8""}]","[{""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/4/segments/0"", ""sha256"": ""6703af3308fff4e266c3e50c6fcd2d8f8e357c08ceb678f0e327d37dbd18467d"", ""excerpt"": ""寺北有濛汜池，夏則有水，冬則竭矣。；“寺”本段明指长秋寺；池在寺北。夏有水、冬竭是原文明确的季节性状态，不是年表或实测水位。；未记具体供排水口；不能用后面华林园“凡此诸海”总说单独认定本池谷水供水，也不能反过来断言它绝无水路。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/corrections/0"", ""sha256"": ""6703af3308fff4e266c3e50c6fcd2d8f8e357c08ceb678f0e327d37dbd18467d"", ""excerpt"": ""{\""id\"": \""P467-I09-POOL-SCOPE\"", \""previous_version\"": \""prosperity-water-p467\"", \""previous_page\"": \""prosperity-water-p467.html\"", \""previous_segment\"": \""I09\"", \""withdrawn_legacy_ids\"": [\""W20\"", \""W21\""], \""withdrawn_fields\"": [\""plates[inner].segments[I09].legacy_water_ids\"", \""legacy_water_coverage[W20/W21].本册图段\""], \""reason\"": \""W20属长秋寺北的季节性池，W21属西游园凌云台下；后文华林园“凡此诸海”不足以承担两池的供水索引。撤回索引不证明两池绝无水路。\"", \""replacement_plate\"": \""palace-pools-audit\"", \""quote_scope\"": \""若旱魃為害，穀水注之不竭；離畢滂潤，陽穀泄之不盈。\"", \""quote_limit\"": \""保留旱涝条件；群体记述不拆为各池口已证连接，不作全年恒定流量或516—528逐年供水表。\"", \""legacy_bytes_policy\"": \""旧PDF、JSON和索引保留发布时字节；前页显著勘误及本记录为当前采用判断。\"", \""source_ids\"": [\""P-Z1\"", \""P-F1\"", \""P-G1\""]}"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_sou