R10-R07-01,R07,宫前御道,门符、寺墙与道路残段保持不同几何对象,来源图宫前门符、永宁墙迹和铜驼路段可联看，不能互作建筑中心或外轮廓。,本区关系图与R9来源图互链；门、墙、路不统一画成完整建筑块。,寺墙缺段、门楼足迹与共同古代坐标未知。,100米工作容差仍不是考古测量误差或本轮定位精度。,"[""ic_changhe_palace"", ""ic_yongning"", ""ic_palace_avenue""]","[""R01"", ""T01""]",[],"[{""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/0""}, {""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/1""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/0""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/21""}]","[{""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/0"", ""sha256"": ""012f82e3ae6fe5f808fe4161ca062a9ab6543bf64ece2cab7712a489eeb68e3d"", ""excerpt"": ""同一来源框能联看宫前门符、永宁寺墙迹和铜驼残段；三者不能互作建筑中心或轮廓。；总图保留06a原值；门符用点、墙迹用原段、道路保留三段，局部窗另画关系。；缺失寺墙不闭合，图符不扩成门楼或院落轮廓。100米工作容差不作测量误差。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json""}, {""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/1"", ""sha256"": ""012f82e3ae6fe5f808fe4161ca062a9ab6543bf64ece2cab7712a489eeb68e3d"", ""excerpt"": ""寺在宫前阊阖门南、御道西是两个独立约束；原文一里没有明确量距基点。；局部窗以门、寺、道三者构图，门南与道西各有标识；一里只作文字。；不把一里换算为图上距离；不混同内城西垣的同名门。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/0"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""{\""id\"": \""R01\"", \""name\"": \""铜驼大道原图纵道\"", \""source_group\"": \""内城来源图路迹\"", \""source_code\"": \""Lz-3\"", \""period\"": \""魏晋至北魏；原材料未逐段细分至516—528年；纳入盛时研究参照不等于各段均已证同时通行。\"", \""source_refs\"": [\""legacy:p462:A\"", \""legacy:p462:B\"", \""legacy:p462:C\"", \""legacy:p462:D\"", \""le