R10-R07-02,R07,宫前御道,永宁门南道西与四邻采用各自参照,门南、道西、寺东太尉、西对永康、南界昭玄、北邻御史是不同约束。,把六项关系分别标边，太尉寺东不误标成道东，四邻不画成闭合院墙。,一里的量距点、各署宽度、院界共线与寺塔中心未知。,关系适用于既有文献综合层，不等于所有对象每年原样共存。,"[""ic_yongning"", ""ic_taiwei"", ""ic_yongkang"", ""ic_zhaoxuan"", ""ic_yushi""]","[""T01""]",[],"[{""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/0""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/1""}, {""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/1""}, {""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/3""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/21""}]","[{""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/0"", ""sha256"": ""bd00e4e455348162bed14493297edb10ed0ce216673deea94023a9c117440988"", ""excerpt"": ""在宮前閶闔門南一里御道西。；范校记录旁引文献作东，当前工作文本取西。宫城阊阖门不可并作城西同名城门。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.5/evidence.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/1"", ""sha256"": ""bd00e4e455348162bed14493297edb10ed0ce216673deea94023a9c117440988"", ""excerpt"": ""其寺東有太尉府，西對永康里，南界昭玄曹，北鄰御史臺。；寺东不等于道路东；南界与北邻不提供院界尺寸。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.5/evidence.json""}, {""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/1"", ""sha256"": ""012f82e3ae6fe5f808fe4161ca062a9ab6543bf64ece2cab7712a489eeb68e3d"", ""excerpt"": ""寺在宫前阊阖门南、御道西是两个独立约束；原文一里没有明确量距基点。；局部窗以门、寺、道三者构图，门南与道西各有标识；一里只作文字。；不把一里换算为图上距离；不混同内城西垣的同名门。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json""}, {""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/3"", ""sha256"": ""012f82e3ae6fe5f808fe4161ca062a9ab6543bf64ece2cab7712a489eeb68e3d"", ""excerpt"": ""右卫府在道西、左卫府在道东；太尉府在寺东、右卫府南。太尉府道西是段落解释。；两卫采用错位图签；寺东关系单独标明，太尉府道西用虚线；司徒—国子学南序另列。；不确定正对、退距、门向和院落面积；南向次序不传递未写明的道路侧别。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/21"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""閶闔門前御道東有左衛府。御道西有右衛府。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}]"
R10-R07-03,R07,宫前御道,官署南序不组成两列镜像街坊,两卫有直接路侧，后续是各自南向链；每一步的南不意味着等距、紧邻或与另一列正对。,东西两列分窗，各署只连直接参照，宗正寺按官署、九级按署名显示。,退距、街口、院落面积和道路侧别逐项独证不足。,寺字与级字不转化成佛塔类型或建筑层数。,"[""ic_zuowei"", ""ic_youwei"", ""ic_situ"", ""ic_taiwei"", ""ic_guozixue"", ""ic_zongzheng"", ""ic_jiuji""]","[""T01""]",[],"[{""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/2""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/3""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/4""}, {""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/3""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/21""}]","[{""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/2"", ""sha256"": ""bd00e4e455348162bed14493297edb10ed0ce216673deea94023a9c117440988"", ""excerpt"": ""閶闔門前御道東有左衛府。府南有司徒府。；司徒府的道东位置还依赖连续段落归组，不是每句都重写路侧。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.5/evidence.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/3"", ""sha256"": ""bd00e4e455348162bed14493297edb10ed0ce216673deea94023a9c117440988"", ""excerpt"": ""司徒府南有國子學堂……國子南有宗正寺，寺南有太廟，廟南有護軍府，府南有衣冠里。；周断作国子学、堂内；范作国子学堂、内有。周据《河南志》补学字，南向次序不受此影响。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.5/evidence.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/4"", ""sha256"": ""bd00e4e455348162bed14493297edb10ed0ce216673deea94023a9c117440988"", ""excerpt"": ""御道西有右衛府，府南有太尉府，府南有將作曹，曹南有九級府，府南有太社，社南有凌陰里。；后续对象路侧按段落继承；南不等于紧邻或等距，九级府功能未详。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.5/evidence.json""}, {""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/3"", ""sha256"": ""012f82e3ae6fe5f808fe4161ca062a9ab6543bf64ece2cab7712a489eeb68e3d"", ""excerpt"": ""右卫府在道西、左卫府在道东；太尉府在寺东、右卫府南。太尉府道西是段落解释。；两卫采用错位图签；寺东关系单独标明，太尉府道西用虚线；司徒—国子学南序另列。；不确定正对、退距、门向和院落面积；南向次序不传递未写明的道路侧别。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/21"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""閶闔門前御道東有左衛府。御道西有右衛府。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}]"
R10-R07-04,R07,宫前御道,太府、太尉及司州异记保留解释层,《河南志》作太府、另列太尉，省九级并增司州；校者的名称取舍不是新的空间观测。,主窗用明确标出的工作链，异记在表中并列，不补第二座确定同期府院。,名称同体、各书时期相容和准确院址未解决。,方向可构造相容排列只说明逻辑不矛盾，不证明历史上完整排列成立。,"[""ic_taifu_alternative"", ""ic_taiwei"", ""ic_jiuji"", ""ic_sizhou""]","[""T01""]",[],"[{""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/5""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/6""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/7""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/8""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/17""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/21""}]","[{""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/5"", ""sha256"": ""bd00e4e455348162bed14493297edb10ed0ce216673deea94023a9c117440988"", ""excerpt"": ""太府寺。〈右衛府南。〉將作曹。〈太府寺南。〉太社。〈將作曹南。〉司州。〈太社南。〉凌陰里。〈司州南，四朝藏冰處。〉；省略九级府和增加司州可与宽泛南向关系共存；太府寺不能仅因近位直接并成太尉别名。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.5/evidence.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/6"", ""sha256"": ""bd00e4e455348162bed14493297edb10ed0ce216673deea94023a9c117440988"", ""excerpt"": ""府南有太尉府。；范据《水经注》太尉、司徒两坊间之语，明确判《河南志》作太府寺为误。本项目记录范的判断，但不以该旁证证明右卫南只有一署。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.5/evidence.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/7"", ""sha256"": ""bd00e4e455348162bed14493297edb10ed0ce216673deea94023a9c117440988"", ""excerpt"": ""曹南有九級府。；周对九级记为未详；不能把功能未详转为不存在。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.5/evidence.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/8"", ""sha256"": ""bd00e4e455348162bed14493297edb10ed0ce216673deea94023a9c117440988"", ""excerpt"": ""太尉府。〈在閭闔門南，永寧寺東……〉……右城內。；同书既列太尉又列太府，不能自动当同名；城内归类是支持城内主案的证据，不排除该书另记门外。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.5/evidence.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/17"", ""sha256"": ""bd00e4e455348162bed14493297edb10ed0ce216673deea94023a9c117440988"", ""excerpt"": ""社南有凌陰里。；这给出两链在方向上的一个相容排列，不能证明此完整排列历史上确实存在。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.5/evidence.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/21"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""閶闔門前御道東有左衛府。御道西有右衛府。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}]"
R10-R07-05,R07,宫前御道,景乐道东明确附带校补条件,景乐道东为补字方案，司徒在其西、高肇在其东、义井在其北为分别保存的方向。,以条件标记和三邻边展开；不把西望正相当变成两寺已证共同中轴。,两寺门向、间距、景乐院界和补字的最终地理检验未定。,不因寺院类型画出未记的塔或固定殿数。,"[""ic_jingle"", ""ic_situ"", ""ic_gaozhao_house"", ""ic_yijing"", ""ic_yongning""]","[""T01""]",[],"[{""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/12""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/13""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/21""}]","[{""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/12"", ""sha256"": ""bd00e4e455348162bed14493297edb10ed0ce216673deea94023a9c117440988"", ""excerpt"": ""閶闔南御道〈東〉，西望永寧寺正相當。；东为补字而非现存传本的无争议原字；正相当不提供距离及真实建筑中轴。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.5/evidence.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/13"", ""sha256"": ""bd00e4e455348162bed14493297edb10ed0ce216673deea94023a9c117440988"", ""excerpt"": ""寺西有司徒府，東有大將軍高肇宅，北連義井里。；周以司徒府位置、义井里及西望永宁支持补东；校者的推理和正文分层。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.5/evidence.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/21"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""閶闔門前御道東有左衛府。御道西有右衛府。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}]"
R10-R07-06,R07,宫前御道,夹路支水和南渠接缝保持未知,文献记支分夹路、经两坊间、永宁在水西；向南渠的每支接口及与其它出口的同体未给。,路侧水群采用短关系符；两端留未知，不画中央长沟或直通洛水新渠。,渠宽、桥涵、南渠身份及R01路迹对应未知。,汉晋水道叙述和北魏寺院参照需分期，不自动作516—528逐年通流。,"[""ic_yongning"", ""ic_taiwei"", ""ic_situ""]","[""R01"", ""T01""]","[""W04"", ""W06""]","[{""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/14""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/5""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/6""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/7""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/8""}, {""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/4""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/0""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/21""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/3""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/5""}]","[{""path"": ""research/v2.5/evidence.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/14"", ""sha256"": ""bd00e4e455348162bed14493297edb10ed0ce216673deea94023a9c117440988"", ""excerpt"": ""渠水又支分夾路南逕出太尉司徒兩坊間，謂之銅駝街……水西有永寧寺。；与《伽蓝记》合读支持当前工作布局；同名官署、具体渠路仍需匹配。不能单句排除太府寺另存。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.5/evidence.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/5"", ""sha256"": ""2459e1deb79bc45514d49e2560f37138024f4469adad10ae95d0150122125a64"", ""excerpt"": ""其一水自千秋門南流……又南流東轉，逕閶闔門南……渠水又枝分夾路，南出逕太尉司徒兩坊間……水西有永寧寺。；此阊阖门为宫门，不并作城西同名门。夹路支分作为水段群，不臆画两渠的精确宽度和每一出口。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.7/passages.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/6"", ""sha256"": ""2459e1deb79bc45514d49e2560f37138024f4469adad10ae95d0150122125a64"", ""excerpt"": ""渠水又西歴廟社之間，南注南渠。；有西转与南注关系；南渠是否就是西明门分入、经庙社后出青阳的支渠，本句没有直接说，列为接缝候选。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.7/passages.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/7"", ""sha256"": ""2459e1deb79bc45514d49e2560f37138024f4469adad10ae95d0150122125a64"", ""excerpt"": ""穀水又南逕西明門……門左枝渠東派入城，逕太社前，又東逕太廟南，又東于靑陽門右下注陽渠。；前不擅译为南。靑陽为此版本字形，不在原引中改为清陽。入城后流经不单独证明两设施的同体和同期。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.7/passages.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/8"", ""sha256"": ""2459e1deb79bc45514d49e2560f37138024f4469adad10ae95d0150122125a64"", ""excerpt"": ""渠水自銅駝街東逕司馬門南……渠水歴司空府前，逕太倉南，出東陽門石橋下注陽渠。；这一路出口与青阳出口、建春外阳渠分别登记；同名受水道未提供三出口的完整连接。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.7/passages.json""}, {""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/4"", ""sha256"": ""012f82e3ae6fe5f808fe4161ca062a9ab6543bf64ece2cab7712a489eeb68e3d"", ""excerpt"": ""既有录文叙述支水夹路、经两坊间及寺在水西；没有逐支给出南渠接口。；用路侧水关系短符号与空心端点表示，明确接口未知，不把水画在道路中线上。；各水支与R01的对应、渠宽、桥涵和南渠身份未核。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/0"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""{\""id\"": \""R01\"", \""name\"": \""铜驼大道原图纵道\"", \""source_group\"": \""内城来源图路迹\"", \""source_code\""