R10-R07-07,R07,宫前御道,道路原段保留缺口和南端,R01来源路迹与T01文献御道只支持宫前地段联读；现有长度与宽度属于所报范围。,三段残线不补齐，候选身份边旁写未知南端；与城南仪式序列分别阅读。,缺段、路端和到宣阳／永桥的连续道路测线未定。,不以全景中道路看似连续作为古路通行或同期证据。,"[""ic_palace_avenue"", ""gate_xuanyang"", ""bridge_yong""]","[""R01"", ""T01""]",[],"[{""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/2""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/13""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/0""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/21""}]","[{""path"": ""research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/2"", ""sha256"": ""012f82e3ae6fe5f808fe4161ca062a9ab6543bf64ece2cab7712a489eeb68e3d"", ""excerpt"": ""R01是来源图残段，T01是文献御道；现有依据只支持宫前地段联读。；总图沿用三段断线；局部窗把R01、T01用候选关系连接，南端标为空心未知端。；缺段及南端不补到宣阳门或永桥；1650米和40—65米不是全程长度或等宽承诺。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/city-spatial-r9/decisions.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/13"", ""sha256"": ""2459e1deb79bc45514d49e2560f37138024f4469adad10ae95d0150122125a64"", ""excerpt"": ""至四月七日，京師諸像皆來此寺。八日，以次入宣陽門，向閶闔宮前受皇帝散花。；是特定仪式的叙述路径；不与普通往来自动合成全年道路。集像、入门、宫前为阶段，未给每段街线。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.7/passages.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/0"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""{\""id\"": \""R01\"", \""name\"": \""铜驼大道原图纵道\"", \""source_group\"": \""内城来源图路迹\"", \""source_code\"": \""Lz-3\"", \""period\"": \""魏晋至北魏；原材料未逐段细分至516—528年；纳入盛时研究参照不等于各段均已证同时通行。\"", \""source_refs\"": [\""legacy:p462:A\"", \""legacy:p462:B\"", \""legacy:p462:C\"", \""legacy:p462:D\"", \""legacy:p462:E\"", \""legacy:p462:F\"", \""legacy: