R10-R10-02,R10,城南门道与寺学,南郊遗址的北魏使用层并不相同,明堂重修沿用早期夯土、太学判为恢复、灵台旧址改寺、辟雍未见北魏重修或改建，各有不同报道。,节点标签分别写建筑、旧址或改用；62.8米只归明堂重修台基，不给其它遗址复制尺寸。,未见重修不等于已经证明完全废弃；各遗址实际功能与时点仍缺。,正文正光中造明堂是520—525时代范围，不取单一年竣工。,"[""v3_lingtai"", ""v3_mingtang"", ""v3_biyong""]",[],[],"[{""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/south-466/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/excavation/phases""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/south-466/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/excavation/mingtang_rebuilt_platform_diameter_m""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/south-466/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/texts/mingtang""}]","[{""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/south-466/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/excavation/phases"", ""sha256"": ""545c09e3a0fc6f91f686e02ff34784455868faf434cc299945e8a49cd9bd0106"", ""excerpt"": ""{\""明堂\"": \""北魏重修沿用早期夯土基址\"", \""太学\"": \""课题组判北魏恢复\"", \""辟雍\"": \""东汉、魏晋为主，北魏未见重修或改建\"", \""灵台\"": \""灵台旧址在北魏改作寺院\""}"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/south-466/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/south-466/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/excavation/mingtang_rebuilt_platform_diameter_m"", ""sha256"": ""545c09e3a0fc6f91f686e02ff34784455868faf434cc299945e8a49cd9bd0106"", ""excerpt"": ""62.8"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/south-466/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/south-466/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/texts/mingtang"", ""sha256"": ""545c09e3a0fc6f91f686e02ff34784455868faf434cc299945e8a49cd9bd0106"", ""excerpt"": ""正光中描述营建时间，未确定开工或落成的单一年份。原图两遗址的符号中心也呈西南与东北的相对关系。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/south-466/readings.json""}]"
R10-R10-03,R10,城南门道与寺学,辟雍残渠按量测对象和断端显示,干渠残180米、宽4—5米，分水处距殿基北约156米；两支折南后均失去踪迹。,以干渠、分支和未知南端三对象表示，不闭合环水或指定外部水源。,156米的殿基测点、入水来源、南端与516—528通流均未定。,北端为调查时洛河冲毁；这不是已经复原的北魏洛水古岸。,"[""v3_biyong""]",[],[],"[{""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/south-466/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/excavation/biyong""}]","[{""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/south-466/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/excavation/biyong"", ""sha256"": ""545c09e3a0fc6f91f686e02ff34784455868faf434cc299945e8a49cd9bd0106"", ""excerpt"": ""{\""trunk_preserved_m\"": 180, \""trunk_width_m\"": [4, 5], \""fork_north_of_hall_approx_m\"": 156, \""lateral_each_gt_m\"": 180, \""south_each_approx_m\"": 400, \""branch_width_m\"": [3, 4], \""local_branch_width_lt_m\"": 2, \""north_end\"": \""为调查时的洛河冲毁\"", \""south_ends\"": \""东、西两支折南后均失去踪迹\"", \""water_source\"": null, \""southern_closure\"": null, \""flow_516_528\"": null, \""frame\"": \""以分水处为原点，依据方位和长度作等比例正交示意。两侧各以180米为下限标示，其余数值保留约数。156米所指为殿基北面的相对量距，原文未明定殿基的具体测点。\""}"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/south-466/readings.json""}]"
R10-R10-04,R10,城南门道与寺学,景明道东、三池与水功分层,寺有三池和碾磑舂簸水功是两类记述；资料没有说每池通哪台设施或哪条外渠。；景明在宣阳门外一里御道东为直接关系，方五百步仍是原单位,寺内用无方向成员签呈现数量和水功，不补三条池渠与引洛水线。；路侧与内部成员分别标边，不按原单位生成寺墙,池位、形状、互通和设施布局未知。,不由立寺年、造塔年给每个池和设施定年。,"[""v3_jingming"", ""road_xuanyang""]","[""T13""]","[""W27""]","[{""path"": ""research/dual-b1/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/9""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b1/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/10""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/3/segments/8""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/3/segments/9""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/3/segments/10""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/33""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/15""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/190""}]","[{""path"": ""research/dual-b1/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/9"", ""sha256"": ""aee1cdc54a4f0888f3793712c559a75489ea484e9786d2bfe370466faedfb26f"", ""excerpt"": ""太后始造七層浮圖一所；虚线表示完成年代及内址未定，不等于一直在建。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b1/decisions.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b1/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/10"", ""sha256"": ""aee1cdc54a4f0888f3793712c559a75489ea484e9786d2bfe370466faedfb26f"", ""excerpt"": ""寺有三池；只知数量和设施，不借地形低处为池塘落位；新地形图也不自动接入这些水系。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b1/decisions.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/3/segments/8"", ""sha256"": ""6703af3308fff4e266c3e50c6fcd2d8f8e357c08ceb678f0e327d37dbd18467d"", ""excerpt"": ""寺有三池，萑蒲菱藕，水物生焉。……𥗇磑舂簸，皆用水功。；“寺有三池”给出明确计数。三个池符号只是这一数量的示意，寺内位置、三池次序及形状都未确定。；不得把三个符号的横排当实际方位，不画池间互通，不由建寺年或造塔年给各池定年，也不从池接向水功设施或外部洛水、阳渠、引洛渠。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/3/segments/9"", ""sha256"": ""6703af3308fff4e266c3e50c6fcd2d8f8e357c08ceb678f0e327d37dbd18467d"", ""excerpt"": ""寺有三池，萑蒲菱藕，水物生焉。……𥗇磑舂簸，皆用水功。；同一寺院条目明说“𥗇磑舂簸，皆用水功”；把水功设施作为寺院叙事中的一组要素单列。𥗇通常释碾，字形校议不产生路线。；此处包含线只表达同属寺院叙事，不表水力连接。原文未说这些设施由三池供水、哪池对应哪种设施，也未记外渠名或516—528逐年运行状态。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/plates/3/segments/10"", ""sha256"": ""6703af3308fff4e266c3e50c6fcd2d8f8e357c08ceb678f0e327d37dbd18467d"", ""excerpt"": ""景明年中立，因以為名。在宣陽門外一里御道東。；“在宣阳门外一里御道东”提供寺与御道的相对方位；一里保持原文单位，不用图上距离换算。；寺的方位不直接确定三池位置；“并门邻洛水”属于同篇后文景明寺南的双女寺，不移给景明寺，也不补一条引洛供水边。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/33"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""在宣陽門外一里御道東。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/15"", ""sha256"": ""6703af3308fff4e266c3e50c6fcd2d8f8e357c08ceb678f0e327d37dbd18467d"", ""excerpt"": ""{\""旧编号\"": \""W27\"", \""本册图\"": \""independent-pools\"", \""状态\"": \""已核可读关系、分期与边界；完整岸线或池口仍未定\""}"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-468/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/190"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""景明寺，宣武皇帝所立也。景明年中立，因以為名。在宣陽門外一里御道東。其寺東西南北方五百步。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}]"
R10-R10-05,R10,城南门道与寺学,景明七层塔的始造与完成严格分开,景明年间立寺，正光年间太后始造七层塔；始造不是完工日期。,营造线将寺成立、塔开始和未知完工分开，构件牌保留未定状态。,塔在528前是否完成、寺内足迹与立面古高未知。,未证完工不等于肯定晚出，也不等于516—528全期在建。,"[""v3_jingming""]",[],[],"[{""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/15""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b8/cross-batch-review.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/4""}]","[{""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/15"", ""sha256"": ""2459e1deb79bc45514d49e2560f37138024f4469adad10ae95d0150122125a64"", ""excerpt"": ""景明年中立，因以為名……正光年中，太后始造七層浮圖。；景明500—503、正光520—525为年号覆盖区间。始造是开始事件，不代表所有后年都仍在建，也不等于完工日期。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.7/passages.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b8/cross-batch-review.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/4"", ""sha256"": ""a3be93e2afc09501b56a00d52d2d0143812104b92c4c23d651c1bb0505b96592"", ""excerpt"": ""主图塔构件至少有两种不同限制：大觉永熙砖塔和平等532始造五层塔明确晚出；景明正光始造、冲觉525后追福、融觉五层和秦太上君五层则缺独立的528前完工保证。不能把“未定”写成“肯定晚出”，也不能因寺院前期存在而把塔补入主层。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b8/cross-batch-review.json""}]"
R10-R10-06,R10,城南门道与寺学,双女寺邻洛水只归两寺,秦太上公西寺、东寺在景明南一里，西东身份与并门邻洛水分别保存；东寺年未定继续保留。,两寺独立图签，洛水邻近边不移给景明，不复制东阳秦太上君寺塔。,古岸、两寺门位、院界与东寺营造年未明。,为父两寺和为母秦太上君是不同记录；西寺时代证据不无条件转给东寺。,"[""v3_qintaigong_w"", ""v3_qintaigong_e"", ""v3_jingming"", ""v2_qintaishangjun""]",[],"[""W01""]","[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/193""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/194""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b6/southeast-outer.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/3""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/0""}]","[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/193"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""東有秦太上公二寺，在景明寺南一里。西寺，太后所立；東寺，皇姨所建。並為父追福，因以名之，時人號為雙女寺。並門鄰洛水。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/194"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""東有秦太上公二寺，在景明寺南一里。西寺，太后所立；東寺，皇姨所建。並門鄰洛水。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b6/southeast-outer.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/3"", ""sha256"": ""0f55556ef5307a5c4e42fccaac91863024e2a8faf64add3905c10bb544854448"", ""excerpt"": ""秦太上君寺，胡太后所立也。……為母追福，因以名焉。……在東陽門外二里御道北，所謂暉文里。；这是东阳门外二里、道北、晖文里的秦太上君寺，为母追福。君与公不能因字近而合并；城南为父的两寺继续用既有独立记录。；寺名或母亲死亡时间不能当作寺院完工日期；二里与外字有传本差异。未据本批新增精确营建年。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b6/southeast-outer.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/0"", ""sha256"": ""bf51dad84680792dafbaacb14bea0a0715fa31a5cf13842fd0096f762132a789"", ""excerpt"": ""{\""旧编号\"": \""W01\"", \""旧称\"": \""北魏洛水主河道\"", \""本册图段\"": \""P03、P08、R02、R07、R08\"", \""状态\"": \""本册分段或分期；不新增岸线\""}"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json""}]"
R10-R10-07,R10,城南门道与寺学,学堂旧址与可迁石经分层,汉国子学堂在开阳御道东，堂前石经为物品群；堂前没有固定为堂南或堂东。,学堂地点与碑刻标签分开，碑刻数量不排列成已知石碑网格。,堂前朝向、各碑布局、学堂建筑足迹和与考古太学的共同控制不足。,546迁经超主层，迁走物品不等于学堂遗址消失；毁后场景仍后置。,"[""v3_hanguozixue"", ""v3_shijing"", ""ic_guozixue""]","[""T14""]",[],"[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/218""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/219""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b1/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/11""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b1/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/12""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/34""}]","[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/218"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""開陽門御道東有漢國子學堂，堂前有三種字石經二十五碑。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/219"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""堂前有三種字石經二十五碑。復有石碑四十八枚。又讚學碑一所，並在堂前。魏文帝作典論六碑。武定四年，大將軍遷石經於鄴。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b1/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/11"", ""sha256"": ""aee1cdc54a4f0888f3793712c559a75489ea484e9786d2bfe370466faedfb26f"", ""excerpt"": ""堂前有三種字石經；前向未定，不将标签右侧位置解释成石经在堂东；不与宫前国子学合并。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b1/decisions.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b1/decisions.json"", ""pointer"": ""/decisions/12"", ""sha256"": ""aee1cdc54a4f0888f3793712c559a75489ea484e9786d2bfe370466faedfb26f"", ""excerpt"": ""大將軍遷石經於鄴；不推断所有碑刻全部迁完或学堂原址消失。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b1/decisions.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/34"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""開陽門御道東有漢國子學堂。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}]"
R10-R10-08,R10,城南门道与寺学,行像仪式阶段不变成新增连续道路,四月七日景明集像、八日入宣阳、向宫前受花为仪式顺序；本段没有经过永桥的记载。,三阶段只在时间窗连序列边，不在城市图拉一条穿桥巡游线。,各寺来像路线、街段、桥是否参与与普通全年交通未知。,未记过桥不是证明所有参与者从未过桥；古历月日不换成公历日。,"[""v3_jingming"", ""gate_xuanyang"", ""ic_changhe_palace"", ""bridge_yong""]","[""B04""]",[],"[{""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/13""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b7/luonan-river-markets.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/4""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/82""}]","[{""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/13"", ""sha256"": ""2459e1deb79bc45514d49e2560f37138024f4469adad10ae95d0150122125a64"", ""excerpt"": ""至四月七日，京師諸像皆來此寺。八日，以次入宣陽門，向閶闔宮前受皇帝散花。；是特定仪式的叙述路径；不与普通往来自动合成全年道路。集像、入门、宫前为阶段，未给每段街线。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.7/passages.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b7/luonan-river-markets.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/4"", ""sha256"": ""0acfc920d242f26f3e8de894085d0e7963ed2a4a74ec981a626a8f8450f8e42d"", ""excerpt"": ""四月七日京師諸像皆來此寺，……至八日，以次入宣陽門，向閶闔宮前受皇帝散花。；此寺指景明寺；行像叙述明确景明集像、宣阳入城和宫前受花。永桥段的出门至洛水关系与这条仪式行程不能因示意轴线重合而拼接。；未记经过永桥不等于证明所有参与者从未过桥；本批只说这段材料不足以建立仪式跨桥路径。月日保留古历，不换算公历。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b7/luonan-river-markets.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/82"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""宣陽門外四里，至洛水上，作浮橋，所謂永橋也。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}]"
R10-R10-09,R10,城南门道与寺学,宣阳宫门方向与永桥身份分开,宣阳北对宫门、南直洛水浮桁为方向参照；浮桁与永桥为工作对应，四里为另一原文门外到水上距离。,决策注记和R11桥窗保留候选身份、原里距及未知登陆点；本区不据现代河道补轴线。,宣阳门测量控制、古河岸、南北登陆点和道路连续性未定。,神龟颂文不是建桥年；2022运河报告本轮继续暂缓。,"[""gate_xuanyang"", ""ic_changhe_palace"", ""bridge_yong""]","[""B04"", ""T13""]","[""W01""]","[{""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/11""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/12""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b7/luonan-river-markets.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/0""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b7/luonan-river-markets.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/1""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/south-466/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/texts/bank_landings""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/82""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/33""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/water-467/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/legacy_water_coverage/0""}]","[{""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/11"", ""sha256"": ""2459e1deb79bc45514d49e2560f37138024f4469adad10ae95d0150122125a64"", ""excerpt"": ""宣陽門外四里，至洛水上，作浮橋，所謂永橋也……南北兩岸有華表……永橋以南，圜丘以北，伊洛之間，夾御道。；记录出门至渡洛以及桥南御道的关系，不保证某年全天通行；河两岸与桥节点不等于河水经过道路。四里保留原单位。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.7/passages.json""}, {""path"": ""research/v2.7/passages.json"", ""pointer"": ""/passages/12"", ""sha256"": ""2459e1deb79bc45514d49e2560f37138024f4469adad10ae95d0150122125a64"", ""excerpt"": ""皇都遷洛，移置于此，對閶闔門，南直洛水浮桁。；对、南直作为方向参照，不变成水流边。该浮桁与永桥的工作对应需身份审查，不能仅靠叠图认定。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/v2.7/passages.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b7/luonan-river-markets.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/0"", ""sha256"": ""0acfc920d242f26f3e8de894085d0e7963ed2a4a74ec981a626a8f8450f8e42d"", ""excerpt"": ""宣陽門外四里，至洛水上，作浮橋，所謂永橋也。；四里是从宣阳门出至洛水桥位的原文距离，桥型明确为浮桥。可表达城门外、洛水上和跨河通行的相对关系；作字本身没有给出始建年或营建主体。；四里不换算米数，不反算河宽；浮桥不提供舟数、桥面宽、桩位、岸线形状或今日河道对应。门、桥与南御道的现图同轴只是显示安排。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b7/luonan-river-markets.json""}, {""path"": ""research/dual-b7/luonan-river-markets.json"", ""pointer"": ""/evidence/1"", ""sha256"": ""0acfc920d242f26f3e8de894085d0e7963ed2a4a74ec981a626a8f8450f8e42d"", ""excerpt"": ""神龜中，常景為汭頌。……水陸兼會，周鄭交衢。爰勒洛汭，敢告中區。；神龟中标注常景作文的事件，不能倒填为永桥始建或完工。水陆兼会和周郑交衢是颂文的交通描写，可作通行背景，不能由此生成具体分叉、汇流、渡口或通往各地的实测路线。；颂文不是桥梁工程记录，也未给某一年每日、全年皆可通行的保证。洛汭是文字地理参照，不能从其释义造出确定河曲。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/dual-b7/luonan-river-markets.json""}, {""path"": ""research/prosperity-v4/south-466/readings.json"", ""pointer"": ""/texts/bank_landings"", ""sha256"": ""545c09e3a0fc6f91f686e02ff34784455868faf434cc299945e8a49cd9bd0106"", ""excerpt"": ""[null, null]"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/prosperity-v4/south-466/readings.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/82"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""宣陽門外四里，至洛水上，作浮橋，所謂永橋也。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/research/roads-r62/catalog.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/33"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""在宣陽門外一里御道東。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/