R10-R10-10,R10,城南门道与寺学,景明西的大统与宅改招福分层,大统在景明西并属利民；其南高显宅后建招福，寺南关系经宅寺叙事承接。,补大统的西向与里属，以及高显宅／招福的条件南向，二寺不继承景明道东。,大统营造年、旧宅与新寺足迹、里界及寺间距离未知。,人谓苏秦旧宅是传称，不作为独立考古确认；宅改寺未提供完整施工日程。,"[""v3_datong"", ""li_limin"", ""house_gaoxian"", ""v3_zhaofu"", ""v3_jingming""]",[],[],"[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/191""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/210""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/192""}]","[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/191"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""大統寺，在景明寺西，即所謂利民里。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/210"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""寺南有三公令史高顯畧宅。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/192"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""寺南有三公令史高顯畧宅。顯畧遂造招福寺。人謂此地是蘇秦舊宅。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}]"
R10-R10-11,R10,城南门道与寺学,报德门距、高阳路侧与延贤里属各归参照,报德开阳门外三里未记道路侧别；高阳王雍宅在津阳门外三里御道西；延贤在劝学东，正觉属于延贤。；津阳门仅作该宅门外里距参照,补三组分立约束，不用两个三里把寺宅对齐；高阳保持前身宅层，正觉仅作里内成员。；补津阳门的里距参照，不闭合门墙或路端,报德与道路的接线、两处量距端点、里界和高阳宅改寺足迹未知。,为太后追福、高阳遇害后改寺及王肃所立分别定时，不能合成同一营造批次。,"[""v3_baode"", ""gate_kaiyang"", ""v3_gaoyang"", ""road_jinyang"", ""li_quanxue"", ""li_yanxian"", ""v3_zhengjue"", ""gate_jinyang"", ""house_gaoyang""]","[""T16""]",[],"[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/195""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/205""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/200""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/36""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/205""}]","[{""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/195"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""報德寺，高祖孝文皇帝所立也。為馮太后追福。在開陽門外三里。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/205"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""高陽王寺，高陽王雍之宅也。在津陽門外三里御道西。雍為尒朱榮所害也，捨宅以為寺。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""data/entities.json"", ""pointer"": ""/200"", ""sha256"": ""829f0c1f97a34fc4155346dec1e765f8efb4981d4a48f0d5aaad0e47c2cec5ed"", ""excerpt"": ""勸學里東有延賢里，里內有正覺寺，尚書令王肅所立也。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""existing_source_record"", ""url"": ""https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/33c14be30f737598fd2b53354f1db14ff424a9ff/data/entities.json""}, {""path"": ""research/roads-r62/catalog.json"", ""pointer"": ""/records/36"", ""sha256"": ""ae2d1733ab8ff67df2c1bd003001323314e43990f9840daced059baf9c69d5cc"", ""excerpt"": ""在津陽門外三里御道西。"", ""excerpt_kind"": ""e